{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457450/extras/bda578883d374b549a9ec2150c209348.webp?t=1764326772\" width=616 height=61 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>REAVE is a brutal, dark fantasy PvPvE extraction game built for VR</strong>. Enter the depths alone or with allies, face off against terrifying monsters and rival players, and fight your way back to the surface with your loot\u2026 if you survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457450/extras/d38d1b35e6641254d22abe456fae664f.poster.avif?t=1764326772\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457450/extras/d38d1b35e6641254d22abe456fae664f.webm?t=1764326772\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457450/extras/d38d1b35e6641254d22abe456fae664f.mp4?t=1764326772\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457450/extras/dad411501dc3700ad0ad44b79ace33c4.webp?t=1764326772\" width=616 height=61 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >REAVE drops you into <strong>treacherous dungeons</strong> where death waits in the shadows. Navigate the Fallen Bastion, a place now inhabited by monstrous horrors, ruthless foes, and unpredictable encounters. Every run is a high-stakes raid where extraction is the only escape... and betrayal is always a threat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face off against players and creatures </strong>in tense VR combat, scavenge powerful gear and loot, then fight to extract with your spoils\u2026 or die trying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457450/extras/54e6c69163086c70fbbe75895c3377e8.poster.avif?t=1764326772\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457450/extras/54e6c69163086c70fbbe75895c3377e8.webm?t=1764326772\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457450/extras/54e6c69163086c70fbbe75895c3377e8.mp4?t=1764326772\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457450/extras/cbac5cf05ce19070f37709faa4faf554.webp?t=1764326772\" width=616 height=61 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter alone or form a three-player party, but remember: <strong>trust is fleeting in REAVE.</strong><br>You may need allies to take down terrifying bosses or survive elite enemy encounters, but the deeper you go, the more tempting betrayal becomes. Will you forge alliances or backstab your companions for loot and glory?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision matters. <strong>Every choice could be your last.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457450/extras/80a33d5012416f09809d1a2425351a3d.poster.avif?t=1764326772\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457450/extras/80a33d5012416f09809d1a2425351a3d.webm?t=1764326772\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457450/extras/80a33d5012416f09809d1a2425351a3d.mp4?t=1764326772\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457450/extras/314d4b2fbadfb499d01616cc892ed90d.webp?t=1764326772\" width=616 height=61 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before you descend, you\u2019ll gather in the encampment, a bustling <strong>social space</strong> above ground.<br>Trade with NPCs, make skill tree choices, grab quests, and connect with other players. Show off your loot, form teams, or scout rivals. This is your moment to plan, to scheme, and to gear up for what lies below. <strong>But once the descent begins\u2026 no one is safe.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457450/extras/2ed34c0a5f08383ab21e42615c97fd71.poster.avif?t=1764326772\" width=600 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457450/extras/2ed34c0a5f08383ab21e42615c97fd71.webm?t=1764326772\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457450/extras/2ed34c0a5f08383ab21e42615c97fd71.mp4?t=1764326772\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457450/extras/7e6052873af952a4f152faac67c9ae05.webp?t=1764326772\" width=616 height=61 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >REAVE\u2019s progression system features a branching <strong>skill tree</strong>, letting you forge your own playstyle. Become a brutal frontline warrior, a silent rogue in the shadows, or in future updates, a wielder of powerful magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master immersive VR combat, choose your own path, and adapt to survive. Every choice you make strengthens your character, or seals your fate in the depths of the Fallen Bastion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457450/extras/a9a78b139dae92d65aecfcb76e5b348c.poster.avif?t=1764326772\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457450/extras/a9a78b139dae92d65aecfcb76e5b348c.webm?t=1764326772\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457450/extras/a9a78b139dae92d65aecfcb76e5b348c.mp4?t=1764326772\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3457450?t=1764326772","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3457450?t=1764326772","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457450/16f8ce94db5c5c0d4b26bb963b16f7215a893d0e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764326772","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457450/16f8ce94db5c5c0d4b26bb963b16f7215a893d0e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764326772","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Tracked Controller Support","id":52},{"description":"VR Only","id":54},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing