, a wielder of powerful magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master immersive VR combat, choose your own path, and adapt to survive. Every choice you make strengthens your character, or seals your fate in the depths of the Fallen Bastion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457450/extras/a9a78b139dae92d65aecfcb76e5b348c.poster.avif?t=1764326772\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457450/extras/a9a78b139dae92d65aecfcb76e5b348c.webm?t=1764326772\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457450/extras/a9a78b139dae92d65aecfcb76e5b348c.mp4?t=1764326772\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Alta"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457450/62676e5b78f595be4d6a902042a8f13eebcebcb0/header.jpg?t=1764326772","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3457450/1228606450/14d6a2d0b2741a0ca717cc0ac62f2964091dc955/1764325955/dash_av1.mpd?t=1764326771","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3457450/1228606450/14d6a2d0b2741a0ca717cc0ac62f2964091dc955/1764325955/dash_h264.mpd?t=1764326771","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3457450/1228606450/14d6a2d0b2741a0ca717cc0ac62f2964091dc955/1764325955/hls_264_master.m3u